Echo Echo can scream at audible to ultrasonic frequencies capable of shattering steel,{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf  Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible 5}} redirecting projectiles in mid-flight,<ref name="KBS" /> blowing up multiple [[Laser Lance]]s,<ref name="B10RP2" /> and even damaging [[Taydenite]] at the right frequency.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Taydenite.PNG]]|group = DJW}} Echo Echo can also transmit sound waves through speakers, such as cellphones which can be used as a weapon for the person on the other line.<ref>''[[Grounded]]''</ref> Echo Echo also has the power of audiokinesis, meaning he can control and manipulate sound. Echo Echo can use this power to amplify other sounds.{{Refn|''Ben 10: Alien Force 2011 Annual'', [[:File:Echo Echo Audiokinesis.png|Page 62]]|group = annual}}

Echo Echo has the ability to create an unknown number of exact duplicates of himself.{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible 5}} These clones act so harmoniously that they can finish each other's sentences. Even if entire groups of his clones are destroyed, Echo Echo can survive as long as at least one of him is still intact.<ref name="APP2" /> Using his self-duplication, Echo Echo can create copies of any object he is holding while making clones.<ref name="I13" />{{Refn|[[:File:Energy Scrambled Gwen and Kevin's Powers.PNG]]|group = GT}}{{Refn|According to Derrick J. Wyatt, Echo Echo's object duplication was due to a glitch in the original Ultimatrix. This ability was removed from Echo Echo's DNA when Ben acquired the new Omnitrix in ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Object Cloning Glitch.png]]|group = DJW}} However, it is unknown if this is canon as [[Matt Wayne]] seemed to be unaware of the existence of glitch powers.{{Refn|http://archive.is/A42xJ|group = MW}}|group = note}}

Echo Echo can use his sonic screams to create a force field, as well as sonic waves.<ref>''[[Special Delivery]]''</ref>

By combining his sonic screams and his self-duplication, Echo Echo can create a wall of sound, where he and his clones create a gigantic sound wave that can deal massive damage to his opponents and structures.<ref name="KBS">''[[Kevin's Big Score]]''</ref><ref name="BaDGtMS">''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]''</ref>

Echo Echo can create an echo chamber, where his clones attack from all directions and keep screaming until the target is knocked out or defeated, as demonstrated in his fights with [[Helen Wheels|Helen]]<ref>''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref> and [[Ultimate Kevin]].<ref name="APP2">''[[Absolute Power: Part 2]]''</ref>

Echo Echo can levitate in the air.<ref>''[[Greetings From Techadon]]''</ref><ref>''[[Return to Forever]]''</ref>

Echo Echo seems to have more strength than his size suggests due to his body generating a vibrating field,{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Alien Creation Card.png]]|group=Bandai|name=card2}} as he can carry a power coupling completely on his own,<ref>''[[Unearthed]]''</ref> and kick off the trunk door from the [[Mark 10]] with one foot.<ref name="APP2" />

With the help of multiple clones, Echo Echo can throw a [[Plumber Ship]] about a meter,<ref>''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]''</ref> carry a Murk [[Gourmand]],<ref>''[[Tummy Trouble]]''</ref> and hold his own against larger opponents such as the [[Mech Dragon|mechanical dragon]],<ref name="B10RP2" /> a [[Highbreed]],<ref name="AT" /> and Ultimate Kevin.<ref name="APP2" />

Echo Echo also appears to be rather durable, as he and his clones were able to withstand being thrown against a wall.<ref name="B10RP2" />

Due to his body generating a vibrating field,{{Refn|group=Bandai|name=card2}} Echo Echo is quite agile, as he is capable of jumping exceptionally high.<ref name="B10RP2">''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 2]]''</ref><ref name="KBS" />

Echo Echo can channel vibrations to enhance his screams, as seen when he touched [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]], who had absorbed [[Varcidium]] that caused him to vibrate when struck by [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]]'s manna.<ref>''[[Undercover]]''</ref>

Using his sonic screams, Echo Echo can locate objects and people, giving him the ability of echolocation.<ref name="AT"/>

By duplicating before cancelling the transformation before merging back, Echo Echo can clone the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] and its user, with the resulting duplicates able to transform into different aliens separately. The copies can then transform back into Echo Echo before remerging into a single copy, returning the user to one single body.<ref>''[[Duped]]''</ref>

