Echo Echo's sonic screams can easily hurt his teammates' ears.<ref name="B10RP2" /><ref>''[[The Flame Keepers' Circle]]''</ref>

There is a limit to the number of duplicates Echo Echo can make, which depends on the amount of energy he has access to.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Transformation Duration.PNG]]|group = DM|name = archive}}

Echo Echo is vulnerable to fire, such as that generated by a [[Methanosian]], an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]'s neuroshock blasts, and electricity generated by a [[Cerebrocrustacean]].<ref name="APP2" />

Echo Echo can be rendered unconscious if hit by a quill from a member of [[Argit]]'s [[Argit's Species|species]].<ref name="KBS" />

Echo Echo can be controlled by a [[Vladat]] via their [[Corruptura]]s.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Can Be Controlled By a Vladat.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

Echo Echo can be affected by the cold virus.<ref name="TSOC">''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]''</ref>

==History==
===Alien Force===
*Echo Echo first appeared in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 2]]'', where he defeated a [[Mech Dragon|mechanical dragon]] and destroyed a large pile of [[Laser Lance]]s.
*In ''[[Kevin's Big Score]]'', Echo Echo defeated [[Argit]].
**The same scene reoccurred on TV in ''[[Fame]]''.
*In ''[[Alone Together]]'', Echo Echo fought [[Reinrassig III]], accidentally got teleported to the planet [[Turrawüste]], defeated a [[Dravec]], and located a [[Teleporter Pod]] by using his echolocation.
*In ''[[Darkstar Rising]]'', Echo Echo briefly battled [[Michael Morningstar (Classic)|Darkstar]] before switching into [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]].
*In ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Echo Echo battled [[Brainstorm]] and [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]] before switching into Negative [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]].
*In ''[[Undercover]]'', Echo Echo defeated some [[DNAlien]]s.
*In ''[[Grounded]]'', Echo Echo was caught by [[Carl Tennyson|Carl]] and [[Sandra Tennyson|Sandra]] and sent back to his room. Despite being unable to help [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] in person, however, he screamed into [[Ben's Cell Phone|his phone]] to defeat some DNAliens until Sandra took his phone away.
*In ''[[Unearthed]]'', Echo Echo defeated some DNAliens.
*In ''[[Don't Fear the Repo]]'', Echo Echo scared the [[Vreedle Brothers]] away.
*In ''[[Fool's Gold]]'', Echo Echo and his clones defeated [[Decka|primal Decka]] by being eaten by him and making him sick before being vomited out.
*In ''[[Singlehanded]]'', Echo Echo defeated [[Sunder]].
*In ''[[Trade-Off!]]'', Echo Echo created some clones to look for Gwen before opting to get into Kevin's [[Kevin's Car (Original)|car]] instead.
*In ''[[Above and Beyond]]'', Echo Echo defeated [[Helen Wheels|Helen]].
*In ''[[The Secret of Chromastone]]'', Echo Echo took out [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] with a sonic sneeze.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Duped]]'', Echo Echo created three [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Bens]] before eventually merging them all back together.
*In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Echo Echo was scanned by [[Oliver Thompson]] for the [[Stalker]] off-screen.
*In ''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]'', Echo Echo went [[Ultimate Echo Echo|Ultimate]] to fight some white [[Necrofriggian (Classic)|Necrofriggian]] guards.
*In ''[[...Nor Iron Bars a Cage]]'', Echo Echo destroyed all the sonic collars the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]] prisoners were wearing.
*In ''[[The Enemy of My Enemy]]'', Echo Echo contained [[Nuclear Fusion Grenade|a nuclear bomb]] to save the [[Plumbers' Academy]] until he went Ultimate to move it out into space.
*In ''[[Absolute Power: Part 2]]'', Echo Echo battled [[Ultimate Kevin]], during which several of his clones were killed and the remaining Echo Echo hidden in the [[Mark 10]] went Ultimate.
*In ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', Echo Echo destroyed some missiles before going Ultimate.
*In ''[[Basic Training]]'', Ultimate Echo Echo made a cameo, suggesting that Ben had transformed into Echo Echo first.
*In ''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]'', Echo Echo threw a [[Plumber Ship]] into a lake.
*In ''[[Greetings From Techadon]]'', Echo Echo fought a [[Techadon Robot]] before going Ultimate. Echo Echo appeared again later when he was changing back to Ben.
*In ''[[The Flame Keepers' Circle]]'', Echo Echo battled some [[Esoterica]] and shattered [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s tank.
*In ''[[Double or Nothing]]'', Echo Echo fought [[Albedo|Negative]] [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] before going Ultimate.
*In ''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]'', Echo Echo went Ultimate to fight [[Elena Valadis|Elena]]. Echo Echo appeared again later when he was changing back to Ben.
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Echo Echo appeared as one of the many aliens when Ben was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
*In ''[[Inspector 13]]'', Echo Echo played tennis with [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]] until they were met by [[Thirteen]].

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[It Was Them]]'', Echo Echo destroyed one of [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s [[Mutant Ant|Mutant Ants]].
*In ''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]'', Echo Echo defeated [[Trombipulor]].
*In ''[[Special Delivery]]'', Echo Echo defeated [[Thunderpig]] and accidentally destroyed [[Ignacius Baumann|Mr. Baumann]]'s car in the process.
*In ''[[Tummy Trouble]]'', Echo Echo tried to bring [[Brownbag]] to safety, but accidentally brought him to the wrong tribe.
*In ''[[Return to Forever]]'', Echo Echo tried to fight the [[Forever Knights]], but was reverted by their DNA scanner.
*In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', [[Skurd]] gave [[Blitzwolfer]] Echo Echo's megaphone to battle a [[Jungle Guardian]].
*In ''[[The Most Dangerous Game Show]]'', Skurd gave [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] Echo Echo's megaphone to draw the contestants' attention. Later, Skurd gave [[Shocksquatch]] the megaphone to battle a [[Way Bad]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Echo Echo appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

