==Etymology==
An [[Wikipedia:Echo|echo]] is the reflection of a sound that arrives at a listener with a delay after the direct sound, referencing Echo Echo's audio-kinetic powers. The repetition of the word "echo" in his name references both the nature of an echo and his self-duplication power.

==Trivia==

*Like [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] and [[Atomix]], Echo Echo gives names to his attacks and moves. The names of the attacks are notably less hammy than the former two. This trait is shared with [[Ultimate Echo Echo]].
*In ''[[FusionFall]]'', there is a [[Fusion Echo Echo|fusion of Echo Echo]] that, when defeated, releases [[Red Knight]] sets.
*[[Duncan Rouleau]] once stated that [[Blitzwolfer]]'s sonic howls are more powerful than Echo Echo's sonic screams.{{Refn|[[:File:Blitzwolfer's Powerful Howl.png]]|group = DR}} He later did not recall making the original statement, elaborating that the answer to the question depends on what the story needs.{{Refn|[[:File:Blitzwolfer's Howls vs Echo Echo Sonic Screams New Response.png]]|group = DR}}
*If [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] were to use Echo Echo with [[Skurd]] attached to the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]], Echo Echo's clones would have to remain huddled to use Skurd's power.{{Refn|[[:File:Skurd Ditto and Echo Echo.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Echo Echo's singing sounds like auto-tune, though he is really good at dubstep.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo Singing.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Dee Bradley Baker]] did Echo Echo's voice by talking while inhaling and squinching his upper throat shut, a technique called "reverse phonation".{{Refn|[[:File:DBB Echo Echo Voice.png]]|group = DBB}}{{Refn|[[:File:DBB Echo Echo Voice 2.png]]|group = DBB}}
*Echo Echo originally had the ability to extend his neck and arms in the pre-production stage of '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]'''.{{Refn|group = ca|name = glen}}
*Echo Echo had concept art drawn by [[Eric Canete]]{{Refn|https://archive.ph/ls3rT|group = EC|name = twitter}} and [[Glen Murakami]], with his final design created by Glen, with color styling by Chris Hooten.{{Refn|https://archive.ph/rGZ9l|group = GW|name = https://www.webstagramsite.com/media/B3vioYgjHZw}}
**Echo Echo's design was approved rather quickly.{{Refn|group = EC|name = twitter}}
*Echo Echo's design was based on an [[Wikipedia:Apple Inc.|Apple]] [[Wikipedia:iPod|iPod]].{{Refn|group = GW|name = https://www.webstagramsite.com/media/B3vioYgjHZw}}
*Echo Echo was originally not supposed to appear in ''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]'', with his role taken by [[Armodrillo]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/7/75/Perfection_DRAFT-1.pdf ''Perfection'' Script First Draft]|group = script}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/26/The_Perfect_Girlfriend_DRAFT-2.pdf ''The Perfect Girlfriend'' Script Second Draft]|group = script|name = second}}
*Echo Echo was supposed to retain the Omnitrix symbol on his chest in the pre-production stage of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo & Four Arms Concept Art by Derrick J. Wyatt.png]]|group = ca}}
*Had [[Albedo|Negative]] Echo Echo appeared in '''Omniverse''', he would have been either a red recolor of Echo Echo's appearance in said series or at least have some red markings.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Negative Echo Echo.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
**Derrick eventually drew a version of Negative Echo Echo in the '''Omniverse''' art style in 2020.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Negative Echo Echo Proof.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Echo Echo is similar in some ways to [https://jojo.fandom.com/wiki/Echoes Echoes], the Stand of Koichi Hirose in Part 4 of the manga and anime series '''[[Wikipedia:Jojo's Bizarre Adventure (2012 TV series)|Jojo's Bizarre Adventure]]'''. 
**Both Echo Echo and Echoes ACT 3 are short, white humanoids with green as a secondary color.
**Echoes (specifically ACT 1 and ACT 2) and Echo Echo are able to unleash powerful sound attacks from multiple angles simultaneously (Echo Echo via his duplication, and Echoes through writing onomatopoeia on surfaces).
*Echo Echo was [[Dwayne McDuffie]]'s favorite Omnitrix alien.{{Refn|[[:File:Dwayne Favorite Alien.PNG]]|group = DM}}
**Echo Echo is also [[LeSean Thomas]], [[Steven T. Seagle]]'s and [[Joe Kelly]]'s favorite Omnitrix alien from '''Alien Force'''.{{Refn|https://archive.is/VSmEq|group = LT}}{{Refn|https://youtu.be/AadtqWBSj1Et1112|group = STS|name = STS}}{{Refn|group = JK|https://twitter.com/yasinemiralkaya/status/1771639134660055254}}
*Derrick preferred Echo Echo to Ultimate Echo Echo.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick's Opinion on the Ultimates' Designs.png]]|group = DJW}}
*When asked if Echo Echo could levitate, Derrick considered it a mistake with his powers.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo's Levitation.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Steven T. Seagle would have liked to replace [[Grey Matter (Dynamite)|Grey Matter]] with Echo Echo as part of the original 10 in the [[Ben 10 (2026 Comics)|Dynamite Continuity]].{{Refn|group = STS|name = STS}}

